\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. \tab Now thank your God,
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj Oh my soul for His kindness towards you.
\par It is He that takes care of our body and our spirit.
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0 Praise ye the Lord;
\par Love the Lord for He is good.
\par  Sing His praise and adoration.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     2. \tab You, benevolent, provides us our body requirements
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0 Let mortal man fully serve you from all His resources
\par We are  your own;
\par Our soul, body and spirit
\par  Shall sing and praise your Holy name.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     3. \tab Lord, nurture all souls by your word of everlasting life.
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0 May we have access to all the things we need for this life.
\par May we be made to thirst for you on each day
\par And may you be our life's support.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     4. \tab Fill  us  with  your  spirit  of unmeasurable power,
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0 And that our life may become like your life which is sacred.
\par Grant us that grace,
\par Until some day when your life
\par Shall become ours eternally.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     5.\tab Good shepherd, come and 
\par         strengthen us all by your great power,
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj And make us fit to take in the heavenly communion
\par Stay by our side
\par Till the day when we get there,
\par \pard           In Heaven where we shall see your face.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

